'''Diver's City''' (ダイバー都市, ''Daibā Toshi'', '''Diver City''') is the 33rd sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 82nd sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 10.3 Update|Version 10.3]] and is currently available up to {{4c}} difficulty. Every battle here involves [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal Enemies]].

==Difficulty==
Highly dependent on the quality of one's [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]], but quite easy if one is prepared. The [[Cathode Influencer|last stage]] is, ironically, the easiest of them all, while the [[Ironsand Beach|second stage]] can be very difficult without reliable [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metal]]s, or [[Talents|Talented]] [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]/[[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]]. However, the second stage can be rushed with a proper lineup, as all enemies there spawn on a timer.
{{LegendDiff|130|170|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Raynard]]: A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] super-backliner with a small blind spot and inconsistent yet powerful [[Surge Attack]]s, but low health. Can be treated like a weaker, mobile version of the [[Surge Base (Enemy Base)|Surge Base]].

