==Trivia==
*This sub-chapter's name is a pun on "diversity".
**It may also be a reference to the 10-episode animated web series ''[https://youtu.be/odbJsPzqL0s Jikken Toshi DIVER CITY]'' (実験都市DIVER CITY, "Experiment City DIVER CITY"), which started being posted by the Twitter account [https://twitter.com/divercity2021 @divercity2021] only a couple months before Diver's City was added to the game.
**Another possible reference is [[wikipedia:DiverCity Tokyo Plaza|DiverCity Tokyo Plaza]], a shopping mall that opened in Tokyo in 2012.
*This is one of the four Uncanny Legends sub-chapters to have no [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic Enemies]], the others being [[DNA Plantation]], [[Spacetime Distortion]], and [[Dead Heat Land]].
*It has the highest [[Ototo Corps|Sprocket]] drop rate of all sub-chapters, likely a reference to every stage containing [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal Enemies]].

